test_all_configs_build:
  [gate 1] arty_current: builds end-to-end (sw/builder/out/endstation_arty_current/)
  [gate 1] arty_4x4: builds end-to-end (sw/builder/out/endstation_arty_4x4/)
  [gate 1] arty_8ch: builds end-to-end (sw/builder/out/endstation_arty_8ch/)
  [gate 1] ax7101_8x8: builds end-to-end (sw/builder/out/endstation_ax7101_8x8/)
  [gate 1] ax7101_1x1_tdm8: builds end-to-end (sw/builder/out/endstation_ax7101_1x1_tdm8/)
test_gptp_plane_reaches_the_instance:
  [gate 1e] 8 real elaborations: the product fabric default is identical across product shapes and to explicit ON; bare-metal option-OFF elaborates as announced verification-only hardware (#259); build.sh, sweep.sh and deploy.sh ship fabric ownership
test_control_placement_key:
  [gate 23n] 5 configs, 2 shipping the split, each split variant differing from its all-fabric one in CTRL_SPLIT_P = 1 and --ctrl-mailbox --ctrl-firmware <its split image> alone; 3 bad keys refused by name; a split key naming the fabric firmware refused; the flip reverted at 8x8 refused
test_placement_recipe:
  [gate 23o] 5 configs: each placement recipe loads to the config stating it, writes the stated argv and changes no tracked file; the two placements' 9 shape artifacts byte for byte equal but for the firmware_version in 2; --write-rtl, --write-fragment and an unknown placement refused by name; 2 planted recipes and 3 planted artifacts refused
test_gptp_plane_instance_gate_bites:
  [gate 1e mutation] 6/6 owner-carrier cuts rejected
test_current_shape_matches_sweep_flags:
  [gate 2] arty_4x4 argv == sweep.sh arty design flags (18 flags)
  [gate 2] ax7101_1x1_tdm8 argv == sweep.sh ax7101 design flags (28 flags, --eth-port e1 == the config)
test_model_id_hashing:
  [gate 8] model-id: deterministic, OUI-prefixed, shape-sensitive (3 mutations), instance-field-insensitive, 4x4 != 8x8, arty_current pinned to 0x001BC50AC1000006
test_sweep_opts_fragments:
  [gate 9] arty: generated OPTS/L2 byte-match sweep.sh inline table (322 chars)
  [gate 9] ax7101: generated OPTS/L2 byte-match sweep.sh inline table (556 chars)
  [gate 9] sh -n clean: sweep.sh + both fragments
test_datapath_params_match_the_instance:
  [gate 23m] 7 real milan_soc.py elaborations in 11 s: for every config the integer parameters Instance("milan_datapath") receives are exactly eb.datapath_params(), the shapes the publication census elaborates; every other keyword is a ROM image path
test_datapath_params_gate_bites:
  [gate 23m mutation] 4/4 cuts rejected in 8 s, each naming its keyword: a binding dropped to 0, a value one short, a keyword the builder does not state, and the split placement's CTRL_SPLIT_P dropped
test_image_identity_gate:
