    the split datapath built without CTRL_SPLIT_P: FINDING placement: a split image whose datapath has CTRL_SPLIT_P = 0 and mailbox ['KL_mbx', 'KL_mbx_cdc', 'KL_mbx_dma', 'KL_mbx_wb', 'ctrl_mbx', 'ctrl_mbx_dma']
