  [gate 28] ax7101_8x8: image ENTITY carries entity_id 0x024B4CFFFE4B4C01, entity_model_id 0x001BC5F6CB4A37D1, entity_capabilities 0x0000C588 (AEM_SUPPORTED set), 9 source(s)/0x4801 + 9 sink(s)/0x4801, AVB_INTERFACE the station MAC 02:4b:4c:4b:4c:01 and its 802.1AS clock_identity - all equal to what ADP advertises (Table 7-2)
